In this table, pre-recorded has an average viewing hours of 8,289,547, which is significantly higher than the 3,560,000 for live events. Furthermore, even at the threshold corresponding to the top roughly 10% of viewing hours (P90), the 20,000,000 for pre-recorded is also much higher than the 6,500,000 for live events.

