What percentage of total watch time was spent on the Top 10 titles of 2026H1?


Code
top10_stats &lt;- NETFLIX_DATA |&gt;
  filter(period == "2026H1") |&gt;
  mutate(period_total = sum(hours_viewed, na.rm = TRUE)) |&gt;
  arrange(desc(hours_viewed)) |&gt;
  slice_head(n = 10) |&gt;
  summarize(
    top_10_share = sum(hours_viewed, na.rm = TRUE) /
      first(period_total)
  )


6.7% of total watch time was spent on the Top 10 titles of 2026H1.
